# A dispatch of an attribute from an attribute.
#
#   ⟦ bar ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧ ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.bar.x ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 bar foo
F c1 x
F c2
Δ c2 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c1 x c2
P c0 bar c1
D c3 c0 bar
D c4 c3 x
P c0 foo c4
